## Workflow

These skills cover code review, PR creation, and repo upkeep.

### Skill Entry Points

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `/make-pr` | Drive a scoped coding task to done via a TDD loop, then create/update the PR (runs gates, fixes errors, links issues, assigns reviewers) |
| `/pr-make-till-merge` | Create a PR from the current branch and babysit it until ready to merge |
| `/pr-babysit` | Poll an open PR, fix review/CI issues, and loop until ready to merge |
| `/review-and-fix` | Review the current diff and fix CRITICAL/MAJOR issues |
| `/multi-review` | Multi-model code review via external AI CLIs |
| `/simplify` | Review changed code for reuse, quality, and efficiency |
| `/issue-make` | Create or update a GitHub issue with planning artifacts |
| `/latest-update` | Pull main, clean up merged branches, validate, install |

